  "description": "ASP.NET Core HTTP Idempotency-Key filter (MVC + Minimal API): shared IdempotencyGate over IDistributedCache, 2xx response envelope replay, RFC 9457 ProblemDetails errors, optional Redis SET NX lock, ProcessingTtl abandoned recovery, opt-in method+path+body fingerprinting, per-endpoint TTL, and optional ActivitySource instrumentation. Host owns cache registration. Uses System.Text.Json. No MCP or Telemetry package coupling.",
